<?xml version="1.0"?>
<ScenContainer xmlns:xsd="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema" xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance">
  <ScenTitle>Sahel Slugfest</ScenTitle>
  <ScenDescription>&lt;BODY text=#dcdcdc bgColor=#2b2b2b scroll=auto&gt;&lt;P&gt;The always volatile Sudan and Chad each have friends in high places. Sudan has taken advantage of western sanctions to establish extensive ties with Beijing, while France has always maintained a presence in its former colony. &lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;The instability in Sudan after the fall of Omar al-Bashir has led to an unprecedented move. Fearful of losing their longtime client, China has pulled all the&amp;nbsp;cloak and daggers, and then&amp;nbsp;embarked on the largest deployment since 1979 to shore up its new strongman. As material flows it, has come on a collision course with Chad and its own patron, which has responded in kind. &lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;Now large-scale fighting seems inevitable.&amp;nbsp; &lt;/P&gt;&lt;/BODY&gt;</ScenDescription>
